<!-- Recommended: Supabase Authentication > Email Templates > Reset password.
     Use ONLY with this frontend's RedirectTo ending in ?recovery=1.
     The fragment keeps the one-use credential out of HTTP request URLs.
     Supabase can sign AMR otp for default implicit recovery, which does not
     distinguish it from a magic link. This template enables Auth verification
     of type recovery before the password form is shown. Never add secrets. -->
<h2>Reset your SafeNest AI password</h2>
<p>Follow this link to choose a new password:</p>
<p><a href="{{ .RedirectTo }}#token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&amp;type=recovery">Reset password</a></p>
<p>If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.</p>
